<title>USA: Optimax ends buy of Madison assets.</title>
<headline>Optimax ends buy of Madison assets.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimax Industries Inc said Wednesday it ended its efforts to buy a giftware merchandising company, apparel manufacturing company and additional giftware and related assets from Madison Sports and Entertainment Inc.</p>
<p>The company announced June 23 it had entered into a non-binding letter of intent to buy the assets of Madison.</p>
<p>The value of the deal was not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose in a written statement Wednesday why it ended the acquisition.</p>
</text>
